theorem `nonneg_prod_iff` / 定理 `nonneg_prod_iff`

English:
theorem nonneg_prod_iff
  statement: [Preorder P] [AddLeftMono P]
  proof: by
  simp_rw [Prod.forall, prod_apply]
  constructor
  · intro h
    constructor
    · intro x; simpa only [add_zero, map_zero] using h x 0
    · intro x; simpa only [zero_add, map_zero] using h 0 x
  · rintro ⟨h₁, h₂⟩ x₁ x₂
    exact add_nonneg (h₁ x₁) (h₂ x₂)

